avmxgrwyko2gMJ4pMjMt0A66zC-Hoygclg&oe=69A59D39"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4 soundbath.png", "id": "1214899389903140", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820574_1214899393236473_8821545736345454299_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eXZmzPORilAQ7kNvwGkjRYo&_nc_oc=AdnMggTQPhXBukLMK2gkf4gAb8oVpzikeTRTY2vbE38NsQ0DTwHtBFQX_zgBtfHqiDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfscRTnTiIGtJF5JXIoxUQ7Z3zF73G5BhvRVII4KKrPllw&oe=69A5924A"}, {"file_name": "TRIPP_Screenshot_2560x1440.png", "id": "1422660415743750", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824592_1422660419077083_2120275037635617437_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ogbcKpcqRgQQ7kNvwFEiMSL&_nc_oc=AdkdH4Sbf2wdkHEDNhDwgekbHQqv1WhbfdU9VIxOBBNMiI3pJLwROoJIln_kCV6FJ0w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afstuj5n4UTeyknYW0UiI2Gs0hDcGrJHc9hc83XpCqYlNw&oe=69A56CBE"}, {"file_name": "TRIPP_Sound Bath_Screenshots Bowls Fish_2560x1440.png", "id": "1567762020861259", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507818746_1567762027527925_8246139963255701258_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q1HNpBLgoBkQ7kNvwEP38wS&_nc_oc=AdkJ6fDIqJoz8BAZzCA-oB-2MhX7Rk5KWxxYxKjTjbtc-NZ_a57OlPbfvwUkBPMS2Z8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftv8N_B1SiZNyEbJS0PXEkUpMglyGduzSzJAGxPnubKjQ&oe=69A5989C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TRIPP_Sound Bath_Video Cover Image_2560x1440.png", "id": "1241952427408769", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301403_1241952434075435_3015933361298508862_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d80kLrdmQwkQ7kNvwFpvlRD&_nc_oc=AdkldascVHCLhnEYGt9evgsc1_Rx6Ne0_171mfD0EPVtXzanp8eguAIAugsTvuxvNJw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfttAOjBlG4NMYykjg1sQ0IIuCyzVUwnA6dttW6T1YxdKA&oe=69A56E3B"}, "display_name": "Sound Bath by TRIPP", "keywords": ["Music", "Rhythm", "Meditation", "Sound", "Creativity"], "long_description": "Step into Sound Bath, a revolutionary VR experience from TRIPP, the award-winning creators of immersive wellness. Sound Bath invites you to become the maestro of your own audiovisual journey, where every sound bowl interaction deepens your connection to calm and creativity.\n\n{759779279809918}\n\nWith two intuitive virtual mallets in hand, explore an array of unique, resonant sound bowls. Each strike unleashes stunning immersive 360\u00b0 art and meticulously engineered soundscapes from a stellar lineup of renowned artists:\n\nDavid Starfire\n\nTi\u00ebsto & 7Skies\n\nLiquid Bloom\n\nCloudchord\n\nEvery note you play dynamically transforms the vibrant, responsive world around you, crafting a personalized, ever-evolving audio-visual masterpiece that's uniquely yours. Witness breathtaking visuals shift and evolve in perfect harmony with your sonic creations.\n\nSound Bath is more than just an experience; it's your personal symphony for the soul, designed to:\n\nInduce Deep Relaxation: Melt away stress and find profound tranquility.\n\nSpark Boundless Creativity: Explore new forms of expression through interactive art and sound.\n\nCultivate Presence: Immerse yourself fully in the moment, enhancing mindfulness.\n\nDiscover a harmonious blend of deep relaxation, boundless creativity, and profound presence. Get Sound Bath today on Meta Quest and redefine your reality.\n{725462406891111}\n\n\n", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a transformative VR Sound Bath created by the award-winning team at TRIPP! Interact with sound bowls to create your own mesmerizing, mind-expanding audio-visual journey. These amazing singing bowls have been designed by top world-renowned musical artists David Starfire, Ti\u00ebsto & 7 Skies, Liquid Bloom, and Cloudchord! Shower your senses in your personal symphony for the soul! Experience deep relaxation & boundless creativity. Your personal symphony for the soul on Meta Quest!"}]}, "developer_nam